      "details": "<p class=\"p1\"><em>Bu\u1e25ayre-i \u1e6caberiyye</em>:\u00a0It is at the beginning of the <em>N\u0101\u1e25iye-i \u0120avr</em> (the Ghawr Valley). Water comes from <em>B\u0101n\u0101s</em> (Banias / Paneas) and flows into the <em>\u1e6caberiyye Bu\u1e25ayresi</em> (Lake Tiberias). Its circuit takes two days\u2019 travel.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"444\">And <em>\u1e6caberiyye</em> (Tiberias) is the name of a ruined city that once stood on the shore of that lake.</p>",
